  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A second training programme for 21 experts from Russian central and regional authorities managing traffic safety and environment issues in transport planning to study the Swedish implementation of measures taken to reduce emissions, noice and other negative factors in the traffic environment and to improve traffic safety.</narrative>
